# Merges the former waiting-session abort and foreground-only interrupt patches:
# session.interrupt gains cancelBackground (default false); a default interrupt only stops
# a live foreground turn and leaves durable background work running; an explicit
# cancelBackground interrupt cancels a waiting Session's background jobs and settles it,
# and Session.remove opts in so removal never orphans background work. Regenerated against
# opencode v2.1.4 (68bc26b7da1990ce10ffecfbc1e09eb13aa5d824).
